# Accessibility

- Interactive controls: keyboard reachable, visible focus (accent sparingly).
- Icon-only buttons need `aria-label`.
- Forms: label association; errors linked via `aria-describedby` / `aria-invalid`.
- Do not rely on color alone for stock/compat status — include text/icon.
- 3D canvases: provide non-3D fallback info (specs still readable if WebGL fails).
- Prefer shadcn primitives (they include solid a11y defaults) over custom divs-as-buttons.
